sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Coord as Coordinator Node
    participant Replica1 as Replica 1 (UP)
    participant Replica2 as Replica 2 (DOWN)
    participant HintsBuffer as Hints Buffer
    participant HintsFile as Hints File
    participant Dispatcher as Hints Dispatcher
    
    Client->>Coord: Write request (RF=3, CL=QUORUM)
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over Coord,Replica2: Normal Replication Attempt
        
        Coord->>Replica1: Write mutation
        Replica1->>Replica1: Write to memtable
        Replica1-->>Coord: ACK (success)
        
        Coord->>Replica2: Write mutation
        Note over Replica2: Node is DOWN<br/>Timeout after 2s
        Replica2--xCoord: Timeout/Connection refused
        
        Note over Coord: CL=QUORUM requires 2/3<br/>Only 1 ACK received<br/>Need to store hint
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 200, 200)
        Note over Coord,HintsBuffer: Hint Creation
        
        Coord->>Coord: Create hint
        Note over Coord: Hint contains:<br/>- Target node ID<br/>- Original mutation<br/>- Timestamp<br/>- TTL (3 hours default)
        
        Coord->>HintsBuffer: Store hint in memory
        Note over HintsBuffer: In-memory buffer<br/>Max size: 128MB per node
        
        alt Buffer has space
            HintsBuffer-->>Coord: Hint buffered
        else Buffer full
            HintsBuffer->>HintsFile: Flush to disk
            Note over HintsFile: Hints stored in<br/>compressed files<br/>hints/{target_node_id}/
        end
        
        Coord-->>Client: Success (if CL met with hints)
    end
    
    Note over Coord,Replica2: Time passes...<br/>Replica2 recovers
    
    rect rgb(200, 240, 255)
        Note over Dispatcher,Replica2: Hint Delivery - Background Process
        
        Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: Check for hints (every 10s)
        Dispatcher->>HintsFile: Read hints for Replica2
        
        Note over Dispatcher: Delivery throttling:<br/>- Max rate: 1024 hints/s<br/>- Back-off on failure<br/>- Pause on overload
        
        loop Delivery batch (128 hints)
            Dispatcher->>Replica2: Send hint batch
            
            alt Replica2 is UP and responsive
                Replica2->>Replica2: Apply mutations
                Replica2->>Replica2: Write to memtable
                Replica2-->>Dispatcher: ACK batch
                Dispatcher->>HintsFile: Mark hints as delivered
            else Replica2 still DOWN
                Replica2--xDispatcher: Timeout
                Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: Exponential back-off
                Note over Dispatcher: Wait before retry<br/>1s → 2s → 4s → 8s...
            end
        end
        
        Dispatcher->>HintsFile: Delete delivered hints
        Note over HintsFile: Cleanup old hint files
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 200)
        Note over Dispatcher,HintsFile: Hint Expiration
        
        alt Hint age > max_hint_window (3 hours)
            Dispatcher->>HintsFile: Delete expired hints
            Note over Dispatcher: Hints dropped<br/>Manual repair needed
        end
    end
    
    Note over Client,Dispatcher: Hint Statistics:<br/>- Created: Counter per target node<br/>- In flight: Current buffered<br/>- Delivered: Total sent<br/>- Failed: Delivery failures
    
    Note over Client,Dispatcher: Configuration:<br/>- max_hint_window_in_ms: 10800000 (3h)<br/>- hinted_handoff_throttle_in_kb: 1024<br/>- max_hints_delivery_threads: 2<br/>- hints_directory: /var/lib/cassandra/hints
    
    style Coord fill:#e1ffe1
    style Replica1 fill:#e1f5ff
    style Replica2 fill:#ffe1e1
    style HintsBuffer fill:#fff4e1
    style HintsFile fill:#ffe1f5
    style Dispatcher fill:#f0e1ff